WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.121
In numbers: forgetting drops to about one tenth of
fine-tuning,

00:00:04.201 --> 00:00:06.788
and new-dataset error to about one half.

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:10.722
In the few-sample regime with only one hundred new
samples,

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:17.790
RAWM scores an equal error rate of zero point nine
two on the old set and zero point three one on the new,

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:20.324
far ahead of fine-tuning's near eight.

00:00:20.404 --> 00:00:26.192
On speech emotion recognition it reaches about
forty-two percent accuracy on MSP-Podcast

00:00:26.272 --> 00:00:28.459
and fifty-four percent on IEMOCAP,

00:00:28.539 --> 00:00:31.793
the best of all continual learning methods tested.

00:00:31.873 --> 00:00:34.860
The optimal regularization weight is one half.
